# latexmk configuration for the ICCIES 2027 paper.
#
# The paper contains Vietnamese tone-marked letters that T1/pdflatex cannot
# typeset, so the PDF must be built with XeLaTeX.  Setting $pdf_mode = 5 here
# makes every latexmk invocation (including the bare `latexmk main.tex` that
# editors run by default) produce the correct 15-page Times-like PDF
# instead of a 17-page pdfLaTeX one with dropped characters.
$pdf_mode = 5;
